    "Spread and viewkick fields are only partial inputs; engine movement, attachments, patterns and runtime modifiers change results.",
    "The data are extracted facts, not copied game script files.",
    "Recoil spring identifiers and base viewkick/kick values are only partial proxies, not measured recoil or controllability.",
    "Burst count/delay, spin-up, rechamber, and charge fields must be considered before interpreting nominal RPM."
